 "title": "30 V N-channel NexFET power MOSFET in 5 mm × 6 mm SON",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SLPS526, March 2015",
  "pages": 12
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel power MOSFET rated for 30 V between drain and source and ±20 V on the gate, in an eight-lead 5 mm × 6 mm SON with an exposed drain pad. On-resistance is 5.9 mΩ typical (6.9 mΩ max) at VGS = 10 V and 7.9 mΩ typical (9.3 mΩ max) at 4.5 V, with total gate charge of 7.9 nC at 4.5 V and 2.0 nC gate-to-drain. It is aimed at the control FET of point-of-load synchronous buck converters. Avalanche rated; lead-free, RoHS and halogen free.",
